    <string name="niuma_widget_description">See how much you\'ve earned today and the countdown to clocking out.</string>
    <string name="manual_s1_title">Stamp Card</string>
    <string name="manual_s1_b1">Add one stamp a day with the reason you want to quit.</string>
    <string name="manual_s1_b2">Complete a card to make a resignation receipt, or start a new card.</string>
    <string name="manual_s1_b3">You get at most one coin per day — but if you\'re really mad, a hidden easter egg lets you stamp a few more (go find it!).</string>
    <string name="manual_s1_b4">Past records and stats live in the History tab at the bottom.</string>
    <string name="manual_s2_title">Exit Plan</string>
    <string name="manual_s2_b1">Freedom Fund: set a target and track how much you\'ve saved.</string>
    <string name="manual_s2_b2">Resume Prep: mark whether your resume is ready.</string>
    <string name="manual_s2_b3">To-Do: plan tasks before quitting, with reminders.</string>
    <string name="manual_s3_title">Salary Counter (BETA)</string>
    <string name="manual_s3_b1">Monthly or hourly pay, with currency choice (TWD/USD/JPY/CNY/custom).</string>
    <string name="manual_s3_b2">See today\'s earnings, countdown to clock-out, and cycle total live.</string>
    <string name="manual_s3_b3">Rest mode: Holidays-Off (auto weekends + holidays) or Shift Schedule.</string>
    <string name="manual_s3_b4">Shift Schedule: fixed hours, or multiple shifts (time/icon/color) assigned on a calendar.</string>
    <string name="manual_s3_b5">Supports multiple paydays, lunch deduction, and overnight shifts.</string>
    <string name="manual_s3_b6">The Home Screen widget shows today\'s earnings and the clock-out countdown, refreshed periodically.</string>
    <string name="manual_s4_title">History</string>
    <string name="manual_s4_b1">Stats: total stamps, cards used, and your top reason.</string>
    <string name="manual_s4_b2">Records grouped by card; edit or delete any entry.</string>
    <string name="manual_s5_title">Comfort Corner</string>
    <string name="manual_s5_b1">Share anonymously after registering (nickname, industry, job title; company optional).</string>
    <string name="manual_s5_b2">To post: stamp on the Stamp Card, then choose to share to the Corner.</string>
    <string name="manual_s5_b3">Work Q&amp;A: besides venting, you can ask a question. Switch to Answers to see only questions — three a day, and rejected ones don\'t count.</string>
    <string name="manual_s5_b4">Industry filter: tap the industry button to select several at once and see only the fields you care about.</string>
    <string name="manual_s5_b5">Today\'s Voices: swipe cards to send ❤️ 💪 😢.</string>
    <string name="manual_s5_b6">Comment on posts (shown after review).</string>
    <string name="manual_s5_b7">Answerer badges: an approved comment earns 10 EXP, one marked helpful earns 100, across five tiers. The person who asked marks which reply actually helped.</string>
    <string name="manual_s5_b8">My Corner: manage your own posts and comments; changing your industry or nickname can update past posts too.</string>
    <string name="manual_s5_b9">Approved posts earn 5 coins.</string>
    <string name="manual_s6_title">Coins &amp; Themes</string>
    <string name="manual_s6_b1">Earn coins: +1 per daily stamp, +5 per approved post.</string>
    <string name="manual_s6_b2">Unlock paid themes in Settings → Theme Shop for 15 coins each; they apply across the whole app, not just the card.</string>
    <string name="manual_s6_b3">Tap a locked theme to preview its colors and stamps — you can even try stamping a few squares.</string>
    <string name="manual_s6_b4">Coins sync to the cloud once you\'ve joined the Corner.</string>
    <string name="manual_s7_title">Account &amp; Linking</string>
    <string name="manual_s7_b1">Two sign-in options: Google or Email — pick whichever you like.</string>
    <string name="manual_s7_b2">Once linked, your coins and stamp records sync across devices, and you can recover your Comfort Corner posts after a reinstall or new device.</string>
    <string name="manual_s7_b3">Completely optional — skipping it doesn\'t affect any existing feature, and you can link later anytime.</string>
    <string name="manual_s7_b4">See your currently linked sign-in method under Settings → Account &amp; Devices.</string>
    <string name="manual_s7_b5">You can delete your cloud account anytime in the app; your local stamp cards, coins, and Comfort Corner data are kept.</string>
    <string name="manual_s8_title">Settings</string>
    <string name="manual_s8_b1">Adjust company name, favorite reasons, card slots, and the Theme Shop.</string>
    <string name="manual_s8_b2">Quote widget: shows resignation quotes on your Home Screen; set the refresh rate (5 min – daily) in Widget Settings.</string>
    <string name="manual_s8_b3">Reset: wipe all data and start over (irreversible).</string>
